---
.title = "Model compatibility",
.description = "Find LLMD models for Chat, Decision, or Embeddings. Look up external drafters and configure a launch on your backend.",
.date = .date("2026-11-16T00:00:00"),
.layout = "content.shtml",
---
Choose a model for your accelerator. Check the
[host and backend requirements]($link.page('llmd/reference/compatibility'))
and allow memory for both the model weights and KV cache.

# [Model catalog]($heading.id('choose-a-checkpoint'))

```=html
<div data-model-catalog hidden>
  <div class="model-catalog-toolbar" data-pagefind-ignore>
    <label class="model-catalog-field">
      Search models
      <input type="search" name="checkpoint" placeholder="Model, family, or drafter" autocomplete="off">
    </label>
    <details class="model-catalog-filter-panel">
      <summary>Filters<span data-model-filter-count></span></summary>
      <div class="model-catalog-filters">
        <label class="model-catalog-field">
          Capability
          <select name="capability">
            <option value="">All capabilities</option>
            <option value="chat">Chat</option>
            <option value="decision">Decision</option>
            <option value="embeddings">Embeddings</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="model-catalog-field">
          Backend
          <select name="backend"><option value="">All backends</option></select>
        </label>
        <label class="model-catalog-field">
          Precision
          <select name="precision"><option value="">All precisions</option></select>
        </label>
        <label class="model-catalog-pairings"><input type="checkbox" name="pairings"> External drafters only</label>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
  <p class="model-catalog-status" role="status" data-pagefind-ignore></p>
  <p data-model-empty hidden data-pagefind-ignore>No models match these filters.</p>
  <div class="model-catalog-navigator" hidden>
    <div class="model-catalog-family-buttons" role="group" aria-labelledby="model-catalog-family-label" data-pagefind-ignore>
      <span id="model-catalog-family-label">Model family</span>
    </div>
    <label class="model-catalog-field model-catalog-family-select" data-pagefind-ignore>
      Model family
      <select name="family" aria-controls="model-catalog-family"></select>
    </label>
    <div id="model-catalog-family" role="region" aria-labelledby="model-catalog-family-heading">
      <div class="model-catalog-family-title" data-pagefind-ignore>
        <h3 id="model-catalog-family-heading"></h3>
        <span data-model-family-count></span>
      </div>
      <label class="model-catalog-field model-catalog-model-select" data-pagefind-ignore>
        Model
        <select name="catalog-model" aria-controls="model-catalog-recipe"></select>
      </label>
      <p class="model-catalog-legend" data-catalog-legend>BF16, FP8, and similar labels show weight precision. <strong>Target</strong> = precision unspecified · <strong>Pairing</strong> = drafter pairing only · <strong>—</strong> = unlisted under these filters.</p>
      <section id="model-catalog-recipe" class="model-catalog-recipe" aria-label="Selected configuration" hidden data-pagefind-ignore>
        <div aria-live="polite">
          <span data-model-details></span>
          <strong><code data-model-checkpoint></code></strong>
        </div>
        <div data-model-routine hidden>
          <div class="model-catalog-configure">
            <label class="model-catalog-field" data-model-request hidden>Request type
              <select name="request"></select>
            </label>
            <label class="model-catalog-field">Decoding mode
              <select name="decoding"></select>
            </label>
            <label class="model-catalog-field model-catalog-drafter-field" hidden>Drafter model
              <select name="drafter" aria-describedby="model-catalog-drafter"></select>
            </label>
          </div>
          <span id="model-catalog-drafter" data-model-drafter></span>
        </div>
        <div class="model-catalog-evidence" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
          <strong data-model-evidence></strong>
          <p data-model-note></p>
        </div>
        <div class="model-catalog-actions">
          <div class="model-catalog-links" data-model-links></div>
          <a data-model-configure>Configure launch</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

> []($block.attrs('model-catalog-table'))
>
